  "body": {
    "comment": "VOTE: Yes | No | Abstain.\n\nSummary: what the action does, in two sentences.\n\nWhy we vote this way: the reasons, with the articles of the Constitution and the figures they rest on.\n\nConflicts of interest: none | describe, and why we abstain.\n\nHow this was prepared: an AI analysis (linked below) reviewed and decided by Matías Falcone for AdaSouls.",
